flowchart TD
  Dashboard --> Boundary[Local peer, Host and Origin checks]
  Boundary --> Auth[Per-run token authentication]
  Auth --> REST[REST /api routes]
  Auth --> WS[WebSocket /ws initial-frame auth]
  REST --> Runtime[Shared Runtime]
  WS <--> Events[Bounded event bus and snapshots]
  Events <--> Runtime
  Runtime --> Repositories[SQLite repositories]
  Runtime --> Halts[Halt manager]
  Runtime --> OS[Explicit Windows proxy and CA actions]
